				<wikidot:authorName>RockTeethMothEyes</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>4022320</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I guess I can see that, but MC&amp;D has always been influenced by profit. Children from rich <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">clients</span> parents getting trapped in a woman's dream-state is a PR disaster, meaning less patrons. If the duck is ethical on the surface, it's feet are paddling on big numbers attached to dollar signs.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
