					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-10639255#post-4185175</guid>
				<title>Re: Author Post</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-10639255/dream-daycare-d2924-6re33-945am#post-4185175</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 15 Mar 2019 04:42:58 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>DrChandra</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1956625</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>If there's one thing I hate to see in an MC&amp;D article, it's underpriced merchandise.</p> <p>900 a month would be cheap for non-anomalous daycare. MC&amp;D isn't trying to undercut the competition, they're selling exclusive experiences to the ultra-wealthy. Their clients would want to brag about how much they're spending on daycare.</p> <p>I'd recommend adding at least one zero to that price.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
